return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.1','translation-revision-date'=>'2021-09-12 00:08:06+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;','project-id-version'=>'Themes - Rara Business','language'=>'id','messages'=>['Rara Business is a free WordPress theme for business and corporate websites. You can use it to build small business (restaurants/cafe, travel, education, hotel, construction, events, wedding planners, fitness, affiliate, fashion, lawyer, consulting, sport/medical shops, spa/temas, political), portfolio, church, online agencies and firms, charity, ecommerce (WooCommerce), and freelancers websites. Rara Business is widgetized, visually appealing and clean. It is responsive, Schema.org compatible, SEO friendly, RTL compatible, speed optimized, and translation ready. Check demo at https://rarathemes.com/previews/?theme=rara-business, read the documentation at https://docs.rarathemes.com/docs/rara-business/, and get support at https://rarathemes.com/support-ticket/.'=>'Rara Business adalah tema WordPress gratis untuk bisnis dan situs web korporasi. Anda dapat menggunakannya untuk membangun situs web untuk bisnis kecil menengah (restoran/kafe, travel, pendidikan, hotel, konstruksi, events, wedding planners, fitness, affiliate, fashion, lawyer, consulting, olahraga/toko medis, spa, politik) portofolio, gereja, badan dan agensi online, charity, ecommerce (WooCommerce), dan pekerja lepas. Rara business memiliki banyak widget, tampak menawan dan rapi. Tema ini responsif, kompatibel dengan Schema.org, ramah SEO, kompatibel dengan RTL, kecepatan yang dioptimalkan, siap diterjemahkan. Lihat demo di https://rarathemes.com/previews/?theme=rara-business, baca dokumentasi di https://docs.rarathemes.com/docs/rara-business/, dan dapatkan bantuan di https://rarathemes.com/support-ticket/.','Rara Business'=>'Rara Business','>'=>'>','View All Blog'=>'Lihat Semua Blog','Contact Form 7'=>'Contact Form 7','Clients Section'=>'Bagian Klien','FAQs Section'=>'Bagian Tanya-Jawab (